# Boss engineering orchestration — versioning policy
#
# VERSIONED (survive clones; other agents need them):
#   BOSS.md, QUALITY_BAR.md, ROUTING.md, OWNERSHIP.md,
#   team/, processes/, templates/, memory/
#
# LOCAL ONLY (run artefacts, screenshots, transient/ephemeral run state):
reports/
STATE.md
JOURNAL.md
METRICS.md

# Never commit secrets. The Boss never stores passwords, tokens, SSH keys,
# Credential Manager values or any secret material here (see BOSS.md §9).
